igation","Technical Reporting","Construction Support","Engineering Judgment"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Final Portfolio Target","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, aim to have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Complete soil-testing project"},{"text":"Site investigation report"},{"text":"SPT/borehole interpretation project"},{"text":"Shallow foundation design"},{"text":"Pile-foundation study"},{"text":"Slope stability analysis"},{"text":"Ground-improvement case study"},{"text":"Geotechnical numerical-analysis project"},{"text":"Geotechnical/site internship"},{"text":"Complete building/infrastructure geotechnical capstone"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Graduate Profile"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Tech/B.E. Civil Engineering → Soil Mechanics → Engineering Geology → Site Investigation → Soil Testing → Foundation Engineering → Settlement → Slope Stability → Ground Improvement → Numerical Geotechnics → Field Internship → Geotechnical Engineer"}]}]}